Package: rlichess
Title: R Client and Analysis Tools for Lichess
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Hiroki", "Yagi", , "hiro.yagi0245@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an interface to the Lichess API (https://lichess.org/api)
    for downloading chess game data, player profiles, and ratings, along with
    tidy tools for analyzing chess performances, openings, and trends.
